RemovePool_PoolRegistry_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── given pool active
   │  └── it should revert with PoolActive
   ├── given pool unknown
   │  └── it should revert with PoolNotFound
   └── given pool exit only
      ├── it should remove the pool from the roster
      ├── it should delete the config
      ├── it should not change the active pool count
      ├── it should increment the epoch
      └── it should emit PoolRemoved
